WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:01.627
All right listen up.

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:02.586
What you’re about to see

00:00:02.586 --> 00:00:04.838
is some real rock 'em
sock 'em football.

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:05.839
Tee it up!

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:06.590
[whistles]

00:00:08.217 --> 00:00:09.092
[grunts]

00:00:09.635 --> 00:00:11.220
The line at the candy
store sure was

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:13.388
backed up due to
Mother’s Day tomorrow.

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:17.434
I can’t believe I almost
forgot Mother’s Day.

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:18.393
Umm.

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:22.814
Ahhh!

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:25.651
You said breakfast in
bed wasn’t messy!

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:27.152
Good grief.

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:29.947
Dear Mom, thank you
for my school lunches.

00:00:29.947 --> 00:00:31.365
Especially the
bologna sandwiches.

00:00:31.823 --> 00:00:33.033
Not so much the Tuna fish.

00:00:34.785 --> 00:00:37.037
We got my mom an ice cream
cake for Mother’s Day.

00:00:37.079 --> 00:00:39.081
Ahh!

00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:43.043
Apparently Mother’s Day is
not her favorite holiday.

00:00:43.585 --> 00:00:45.462
I don’t know why I get so upset.

00:00:45.462 --> 00:00:46.880
Because you miss your mom?

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.298
I never had a mom.

00:00:48.298 --> 00:00:49.841
Maybe you miss what moms do!

00:00:49.841 --> 00:00:52.010
My dad does all that
mom stuff for me.

00:00:52.803 --> 00:00:55.597
For Mother’s Day I’m going
to celebrate my dad.

00:00:55.639 --> 00:00:56.348
Woo-hoo!

00:00:57.516 --> 00:00:59.226
There are all types
of moms, right?

00:00:59.476 --> 00:01:00.102
Of course!

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:02.688
Some kids have two moms!

00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:04.606
And even kids like me

00:01:04.606 --> 00:01:06.275
can have someone who
acts like a mom.

00:01:06.692 --> 00:01:09.069
All those moms deserve
to be celebrated!

00:01:09.528 --> 00:01:11.530
[laughs]

00:01:11.697 --> 00:01:13.699
♪♪

